WordHunterWoW_QuestEN[36719] = { title = "Into Aegwynn's Retreat", description = "If we're going to defeat that demon, we need something to put us on its level. Something... powerful...\n\n<Khadgar looks thoughtfully at Atiesh, his staff.>\n\nYou need a weapon. Something of great power. And if my assumptions are correct, it shouldn't be too far from here.\n\nI can send you to go find this weapon. Speak with me when you're prepared.", objectives = "Speak with Khadgar.If we're going to defeat that demon, we need something to put us on its level. Something... powerful...\n\n<Khadgar looks thoughtfully at Atiesh, his staff.>\n\nYou need a weapon. Something of great power. And if my assumptions are correct, it shouldn't be too far from here.\n\nI can send you to go find this weapon. Speak with me when you're prepared.You will receive:\n\nUpon completion of this quest you will gain:" }
